# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SENTINEL SOC (soc-suite/) runtime + build artifacts.
# Deliberately ignored: local virtualenvs, installed modules, the SQLite audit
# database (per-analyst runtime state), rotated log captures and build output.
